title: "UACR micro-paper image classification: code, image dataset, results, diagnosis application and device design"
type: software
abstract: "Complete analysis notebook with stored results, image dataset and de-identified label table, PyQt5 application of the prototype device, and device design files for UACR (NORMAL/MICRO/MACRO) classification from paired paper-based colorimetric images."
